; HYPOTHETICAL -- NOT L0. Does not check. Assumes the facilities listed in
; README.md in this directory: write_stderr and the argv form of main, whose
; int result is the exit status.
;
; Limit 07's failure, reported: a message of the program's choosing on
; stderr, nothing on stdout, and exit status 1.

(def main ((args (list (list int)))) int
  (let w (write_stderr "filecopy: in.txt: No such file or directory\n")
    1))
